### Reset metrics (optional)
POST http://localhost:8002/metrics/reset

### user-a: +100.00
POST http://localhost:8002/transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"user_id": "user-a",
	"amount": 100.00
}

### user-a: -25.50
POST http://localhost:8002/transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"user_id": "user-a",
	"amount": -25.50
}

### user-b: +40.00
POST http://localhost:8002/transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"user_id": "user-b",
	"amount": 40.00
}

### user-b: -10.00
POST http://localhost:8002/transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"user_id": "user-b",
	"amount": -10.00
}

### user-c: +7.75
POST http://localhost:8002/transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"user_id": "user-c",
	"amount": 7.75
}

### Fetch user-a summary (balance should be 74.50)
GET http://localhost:8002/user/user-a

### Fetch user-b summary (balance should be 30.00)
GET http://localhost:8002/user/user-b

### Fetch user-c summary (balance should be 7.75)
GET http://localhost:8002/user/user-c

### Fetch all accounts
GET http://localhost:8002/accounts

### Fetch metrics
GET http://localhost:8002/metrics
